  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated and Inclusive Municipality of Vrapcishte - Leave No One Behind</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action aims toward building a sustainable future for children and persons with disabilities of the Municipality of Vrapcishte. The specific objectives are: Provided an educational facility for children with disabilities to learn and socialize within the community they live in; Improved their access to employment, community social, and outreach resources; To replicate and adapt best practice solutions from Slovenian local authorities in EU Member State&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
